[5.68,"o","    bytes: 56\r\n"]
[5.72,"o","    files: 1\r\n"]
[5.76,"o","    largest_1: wp-content/uploads/2026\r\n"]
[5.8,"o","    largest_1_bytes: 56\r\n"]
[5.84,"o","    location_unconfirmed: the upload_path option, which can move the uploads directory, could not be read: database connection failed: Could not connect to the database (error 2002): php_network_getaddresses: getaddrinfo for [redacted] failed: nodename nor servname provided, or not known\r\n"]
[5.88,"o","    Fix: Look at the largest folders first when the disk or the backups are too large. Media that no post uses can be found with a media cleanup plugin; folders that plugins left behind can be removed after a backup.\r\n"]
[5.92,"o","\r\n"]
